sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Broker as MQTT broker
    participant Shadow as Shadow service
    Note over Client,Shadow: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    Client->>Broker: TLS and MQTT CONNECT
    alt Authentication accepted
        Broker-->>Client: CONNACK success
        Client->>Broker: SUBSCRIBE R/get/accepted and R/get/rejected
        Broker-->>Client: SUBACK result
        opt Subscriptions accepted
            Client->>Broker: PUBLISH R/get (clientToken=diagnostic-read)
            Broker-->>Client: PUBACK (not a Shadow result)
            Broker->>Shadow: R/get
            alt State exists
                Shadow-->>Broker: R/get/accepted
                Broker-->>Client: Correlated full state
            else Missing Shadow
                Shadow-->>Broker: R/get/rejected (404)
                Broker-->>Client: Correlated rejected response
            end
            opt Deadline expires without response
                Note over Client: Unknown outcome, inspect layer and retry a read within budget
            end
        end
    else Connection rejected
        Broker-->>Client: Connection rejection or closure
        Note over Client: Inspect current identity and endpoint before topics
    end
